# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
#   cp .env.example .env
# .env is git-ignored. Never commit it. Never paste a real key into any other file.
#
# You may not need any of these. Delete what your project doesn't use.

# --- Only if YOUR APP calls an AI or other API at runtime ---
# This is NOT the key your coding assistant uses in VS Code. That one lives in
# your editor's settings, not in this repo.
#
# WARNING, static-web track: a static site has no server. Every value here would
# be visible to anyone who opens your page. Do not use this file for a static
# site. See docs/deploying.md for the two safe patterns.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Deployment ---
# On Streamlit Community Cloud, do NOT upload .env. Paste these into the app's
# Secrets panel in the Streamlit dashboard instead.
